ruyiseek (0.1.0-13) unstable; urgency=high

  * Fix the UOS runtime bundle to copy each SONAME symlink and its resolved
    ELF file. Previous packages shipped 26 dangling links and silently fell
    back to system libraries. Keep the target's matched loader/glibc pair and
    bundle the non-glibc X11, font and C++ closure.
  * Validate the package through its extracted loader with the host cache
    disabled. Reject dangling links, escaped dependencies and UI symbols newer
    than the UOS 20 GLIBC_2.28 baseline.
  * Remove machine-specific /home/syc paths, musl-stage and shim.o from the
    Cargo configuration. Clean CLI and daemon builds now use Rust's bundled
    musl target and rust-lld without installing host dependencies.
  * Stop rewriting Rust PIE files with UOS patchelf 0.10, which corrupts their
    program headers. Emit a transitive origin-relative RPATH at link time.
  * Build in a temporary package root instead of modifying packaging/deb in
    place. Do not ship build.sh, bundle-libs.sh or recursive_ldd.sh at /.
  * Build with dpkg-deb --root-owner-group directly, generate a SHA-256 file,
    and add package structure, ABI, UI and daemon/CLI protocol smoke tests.
  * Claim the daemon socket before the initial index scan and teach the UI to
    distinguish an initializing daemon from a missing one. This prevents the
    systemd UI/daemon startup race observed on UOS from creating two indexers.

